request.description:
Grant report access directly without request flow (REPORTS scope only). Either doctorId or hospitalId must be provided. expiresAt optional (null = never expires). (PATIENT only)

**Example: Grant to doctor**
{"doctorId": 1, "hospitalId": null, "expiresAt": "2025-12-31T23:59:59", "notes": "For consultation"}

**Example: Grant to hospital**
{"doctorId": null, "hospitalId": 1, "expiresAt": null, "notes": "For ongoing treatment"}
